			<h2 class={h2}>What is this, really?</h2>
			<p class={lede}>Instead of trusting one company to hold your files, you rent space from many strangers' computers — and they have to keep proving they still have your data, or they lose money. No trust required.</p>

			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-center gap-1">
